# THE CAVE'S WALLS (limestone_caves, world.gdshader strata 13): the scraped
# lips read as fine pale ink lines and the curtains hang, with no bright broken
# shimmer on the faces. Under an open tear in the roof (GenAbove), where the day
# comes down onto the walls: under the lid the halls are dark and a frame of them
# proves nothing. Over the shoulder at eye level and from above.
#   TOUR_FIXED_FPS=60 tools/tour.sh tours/cave-walls.tour --seed=7 --realm=underground --hour=12
coast calm
wait 1.0
near shaft_pool
wait 1.5
shot 01-walls-from-above
tap shoulder
await shoulder 20
# Turned to face into the tear's light, the hall's walls lit along the left.
mouse -1280,0 1.2
wait 1.0
shot 02-walls-at-eye-level with shoulder
